# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sanctuary — source-only repository.
# The on-device model is ~2.5 GB and is NEVER committed; it is
# side-loaded onto the device (see README "On-device model").
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── On-device AI models & weights ────────────────────────────
# The model lives in assets/.aistudio/ locally and is pushed to
# the device with adb. Belt and braces: ignore the folder AND
# every weight format.
assets/.aistudio/
assets/.aistudo/
*.litertlm
*.tflite
*.task
*.bin
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.pb
*.npz
*.mlmodel
*.mlpackage
*.aar

# ── Archives & local downloads ───────────────────────────────
flutter/
sanctuary.zip
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar

# ── Crash dumps, logcat captures & profiling output ──────────
# Multi-MB debugging artifacts, not source. The *crash*.txt and
# logcat*.txt patterns matter — the *.log rule does not match
# them, so these were slipping through.
*.log
crash_log.txt
*crash*.txt
logcat*.txt
tombstone*
*.hprof
*.dmp
*.trace
*.cpuprofile
sanctuary_crash_log.txt

