scratch/
# Assistant tooling config, all of it. This used to commit
# .claude/settings.json as "shared project config" and ignore only the personal
# overrides — but none of it describes the app, it differs per machine and per
# person, and the local file has already accumulated absolute Windows paths and
# device-specific adb commands. Keeping the whole directory out is simpler than
# maintaining the split.
.claude/
